== Overview ==
'''Flying Buzzsaw Toilet''' is a fast and enemy which can also stun [[Units]] and appears very early in [[Nightmare Mode]] making him a bit of a threat. It can stun [[Units]] using its big saw. You should try to defeat it as it gives 200$ upon death. Plus it can deal quite a lot of damage to the base if it reaches the end. 

== Health ==

* Wave 10: 23500 (Solo)
HP goes up every wave and depends on the amount of players in a match.

== Abilities ==
The flying Buzzsaw toilet can stun units and go to the base and you lose

